Chromium: mark sndio CreateAudioManager backend param [[maybe_unused]].

Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted), not submitted upstream.
Source: Chromium electron-source tree under EmberBSD.
Apply after other media/audio patches.
kAudioBackendParam.Get() is only consumed under USE_PULSEAUDIO /
USE_SNDIO / USE_ALSA. When those defines are absent in this TU (common
for the NetBSD media/audio target), -Wunused-variable under -Werror
fails the build on `_ab`.

